{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53837","headline":"题龙宫寺净院四上人 · 李绅","name":"题龙宫寺净院四上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拥褐梵香四道师，灵山香侣自肩随。\n前期鴈塔应同化，今日龙宫又再期。\n炎月护生依宝地，夜灯观性息禅枝。\n东方几度留车马，谈尽空门习氏知。\n（以上二首见宋林师蒧《天台前集》卷中）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53837.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53837","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}